.nh
.TH "PB-RECIPE-SCHEMA" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recipe-schema - Print the recipe file JSON Schema


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recipe schema [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the JSON Schema of the recipe file, for editors and AI agents that write it.
The schema is built into pb, so this command works offline and needs no sign-in.
Point a file at it with a "$schema" key.

.PP
This command does not support --json output; it rejects that mode before execution. Use --help --json for structured command help.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for schema


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb recipe schema > recipe.schema.json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-recipe(1)\fP
